Following from the logic inherent in the fact that the healing spell
can heal non-living monsters (such as iron golems), this is a patch
that makes it so that casting the healing or extra healing spell does
the following to objects:

* Rusted, rotted, corroded or burnt objects will lose one (two if extra
healing) level of erosion.
* Partly eaten food becomes complete food again.

NOTE: This does not cure diseased (i.e tainted) corpses, which will
still cause food poisoning when eaten and will still rot away.

